<p> BORROWER   BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.125     MATURITY    11.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.10    PAY DATE    11.JUL.97</p>
